# BUGS

Only power domains' and clocks' on and off are sent: no performance levels, sensors, resets or the platform's own messages (the second mailbox and its notifications aren't read).
The channels are polled, not interrupted.
Firmware's SMC channel exists only by a board rule; nothing in ACPI describes it.
